import{_ as i,o as a,c as n,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 313 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Myriad Races Republican Plan: Breaking Human Centeredness","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 313 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Myriad Races Republican Plan: Breaking Human Centeredness","no":313,"module":2,"tags":["Shrouding the Heavens","Myriad Races Republicanism","Human Centeredness","Demon-Race Equality","Institutional Design"],"related":["05-Myriad Races Common Progress Basic Program","50-Myriad Races Genealogy Overview","77-Founding of Myriad Races Republicanism"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0313_模块2-遮天-万族共和方案.md","filePath":"en/0313_模块2-遮天-万族共和方案.md"}'),s={name:"en/0313_模块2-遮天-万族共和方案.md"};function o(r,e,l,c,u,d){return a(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-313-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-myriad-races-republican-plan-breaking-human-centeredness" tabindex="-1">Entry 313 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Myriad Races Republican Plan: Breaking Human Centeredness <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-313-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-myriad-races-republican-plan-breaking-human-centeredness" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 313 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Myriad Races Republican Plan: Breaking Human Centeredness&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Shrouding-the-Heavens System (Entry 26) | Benchmark base: Documents 05, 50, 77</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-return-the-cosmos-to-myriad-ranks" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Return the cosmos to Myriad Ranks <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-return-the-cosmos-to-myriad-ranks" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Return the cosmos to Myriad Ranks&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the republican axiom of Myriad Races is this entry&#39;s core — all beings have equal evolution qualification, Myriad Ranks 99% full coverage. This entry targets Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; human centeredness (Entry 302) and the demon race&#39;s marginalized situation (Entry 301), giving the concrete Myriad-Races republicanization plan. The law-first axiom requires: republicanization is not a slogan, but redistribution of seats, paths, resources. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = medium (oligarchic civilization). The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Wastes caused by human centeredness (demon-race talent wasted, knowledge flow closed, racial-war internal friction) all released after Myriad-Races republicanization: demon-race physique talents integrated into civilization construction, Myriad-Rank knowledge complements each other, racial war disappears.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Racial inequality&#39;s three regression mechanisms (qualification discrimination, boundary closure, diversity lost) are respectively handled after republicanization:</p><ol><li>Qualification discrimination → Myriad Ranks equal constitutionalized</li><li>Boundary closure → Myriad-Rank knowledge whole-network shared</li><li>Diversity lost → Myriad Ranks five genealogies each with complete path</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Ye Fan&#39;s &quot;for our humanity&quot; justice narrative is re-examined from the Myriad-Races republican perspective: guarding humanity is legitimate, but placing humanity&#39;s interests above Myriad Ranks is predation at the racial level. Republicanization requires Ye Fan to shift from &quot;humanity&#39;s guardian&quot; to &quot;one member of the Myriad Ranks Council.&quot;</p><p>Myriad Races republicanism also has a practical difficulty: different races&#39; evolution paces differ enormously. The demon race may take a millennium to human-shape-shift; humanity builds foundation in decades; plant spirits perceive the world on century scales. If deliberated at the same pace, young races never get a word in. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s practice is to design different deliberation cycles and expression channels for different races — not all vote simultaneously, but each race participates at its own pace, ultimately reaching cross-pace consensus in the Anchor Council. This is far more complex than Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; &quot;humanity decides, demon race listens&quot; structure, but it truly realizes Myriad Races republicanism.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Shrouding Human Centeredness</th><th>Myriad Races Republican Plan</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Humanity as default protagonist race</td><td>Myriad Ranks five genealogies equal constitutionalized</td></tr><tr><td>Demon race as mount / vassal / enemy</td><td>Demon race as equal citizen, with independent Dao legacies</td></tr><tr><td>Female cultivators attached</td><td>Human men and women equal rights and rank</td></tr><tr><td>Humanity monopolizes the highest Great Dao</td><td>300 systems shared by Myriad Ranks</td></tr><tr><td>Periodic racial war</td><td>Myriad Ranks co-build, civil war zero</td></tr><tr><td>Council has human privilege</td><td>Anchor Council Myriad-Rank representatives proportionate</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Shrouding human / demon / other races&#39; resource distribution</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: inject Myriad-Races republicanization reform</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: Myriad-Rank success rate, racial-war frequency, civilization total-energy diversity</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: conclusion — after reform Myriad-Rank success rate rises several times, racial war zero, civilization total energy rises significantly due to diversity innovation</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Post-reform self-consistency</strong>: high</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk</strong>: zero</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: drops from medium to low — Ye Fan no longer monopolizes cosmic narrative as &quot;humanity&#39;s representative&quot;</li></ul><p>Myriad Races republicanism also has a cultural-fusion problem: different races&#39; values differ enormously; how does the Council reach consensus? Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer is not to force unified values, but on the &quot;six top-level axioms&quot; minimum consensus, allow each race to retain its cultural details. Myriad Races republicanism ≠ Myriad Ranks homogenization, but plural coexistence on a minimum consensus. Shrouding-the-Heavens world has not even reached the minimum consensus (humanity-demon equality), let alone fusion at higher levels.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: release demon-race talent, eliminate racial war</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: extend evolution qualification from humanity alone to Myriad Ranks</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo universal-benefits only within humanity; this plan directly breaks racial boundaries</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: this entry is the Myriad-Races axiom&#39;s engineering realization</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: Myriad Races republicanism is the precondition for cross-multiverse civilization intercourse</li></ul><p>Myriad Races republicanism also needs to handle &quot;demon-race shape-shift right.&quot; In Shrouding-the-Heavens, a demon is recognized as an intelligent race only after human-shape-shifting; Heng Yuan Zhou requires the demon race to retain its own form and still enjoy full citizenship; shape-shifting is the demon race&#39;s free choice, not the threshold to enter civilization. This is the shift from &quot;assimilation-style equality&quot; to &quot;ontological equality.&quot;</p><ul><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Shrouding-the-Heavens world&#39;s &quot;cosmos&quot; is actually only &quot;humanity&#39;s cosmos.&quot; A true cosmos must invite the demon race, foreign races, all sentient beings back to the table. Ye Fan may sit, but he cannot monopolize the seat.</p><p>Myriad Races republicanism is not pulling the demon race up to humanity&#39;s position, but canceling &quot;position high/low&quot; itself. The demon race&#39;s problem in Shrouding-the-Heavens is not that its position is not high enough, but that there is no such thing as equal position at all.</p><p>Myriad Races republicanism also requires &quot;demon-race cultivation systems&quot; and &quot;humanity cultivation systems&quot; to exist in parallel, not humanity&#39;s system transforming the demon race. In Shrouding-the-Heavens world, demon-race cultivation is mostly a variant of humanity&#39;s system; Heng Yuan Zhou retains for the demon race an independent path based on its physique traits, so the demon race need not human-shape-shift to reach the endpoint.</p><p>Myriad Races republicanism does not want to eliminate racial differences, but to make differences no longer a reason for privilege or discrimination. Every race has its own beauty; civilization is a plural ensemble, not a single unison.</p><p>In the final analysis, Shrouding-the-Heavens · Myriad Races republican plan described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./301_模块2-遮天-妖族处境.html">Entry 301 · Demon-Race Situation</a> · <a href="./302_模块2-遮天-人族本位批判.html">Entry 302 · Human-Centered Critique</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/05-万族共进基本纲领.html">05-Myriad Races Common Progress Basic Program</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const p=i(s,[["render",o]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
